 "remarks": "Move right into this freshly painted, charming two bedroom corner unit which features hardwood floors, high ceilings, updated kitchen and bath, lots of light and pretty views. Woodside Green is an oasis in the city with its large expanse of lawn with specimen trees, sidewalks, attractive plantings and a gazebo It is a pet friendly community within a short walk of Starbucks, Stop and Shop(and many other shops), Scalzi Park and a peaceful walkway along the Rippowam River. Two parking spaces allowed with this unit and parking is nearby. Hot water and cooking gas are included in the common charges. Interior photos will be posted when painting is completed.",
